The '''Aristocrat Passage''' is a passage connecting the {{Zone|Great Ice Wall}}, {{Zone|Royal Mines}}, and {{Zone|Hanging Court}}. It consists of a staircase in the Hanging Court, leading down into a corridor that serves as a passageway into the Royal Mines: a junction in the middle leads to the Great Ice Wall.

